            <h3 class="text-[28px] font-franklin-demi text-black/70 tracking-[5.6px] uppercase mb-6 leading-tight">WHEEL VIBRATION</h3>
            <div class="space-y-2">
              <p class="text-[20px] font-franklin-book text-black/70 tracking-[1px] leading-[32px]">• Verify proper torque on all lug nuts.</p>
              <p class="text-[20px] font-franklin-book text-black/70 tracking-[1px] leading-[32px]">• Have wheels balanced by a professional.</p>
              <p class="text-[20px] font-franklin-book text-black/70 tracking-[1px] leading-[32px]">• Check for bent wheels or damaged tires.</p>
              <p class="text-[20px] font-franklin-book text-black/70 tracking-[1px] leading-[32px]">• Ensure hub surface was properly cleaned.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-[28px] font-franklin-demi text-black/70 tracking-[5.6px] uppercase mb-6 leading-tight">TPMS WARNING LIGHT</h3>
            <div class="space-y-2">
              <p class="text-[20px] font-franklin-book text-black/70 tracking-[1px] leading-[32px]">• Perform TPMS relearn procedure.</p>
              <p class="text-[20px] font-franklin-book text-black/70 tracking-[1px] leading-[32px]">• Check tire pressure and adjust as needed.</p>
              <p class="text-[20px] font-franklin-book text-black/70 tracking-[1px] leading-[32px]">• Verify sensor batteries are functional.</p>
              <p class="text-[20px] font-franklin-book text-black/70 tracking-[1px] leading-[32px]">• Scan for TPMS fault codes.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-[28px] font-franklin-demi text-black/70 tracking-[5.6px] uppercase mb-6 leading-tight">CENTER CAP LOOSE</h3>
