              <p class="text-[20px] font-franklin-book text-black/70 tracking-[1px] leading-[32px]">• Check for debris in wheel center bore.</p>
              <p class="text-[20px] font-franklin-book text-black/70 tracking-[1px] leading-[32px]">• Inspect cap retention clips.</p>
